ing the American people servants to the establishment. He may try and throw in some sound bites that by design are there to confuse people about who he is and what he stands for. But the honest fact remains, he is very likely a person that can not do as well in life in the private sector as he does in the tax feeder sector. &lt;br /&gt;Never forget the golden lie, &amp;quot;Hi we are here from the government and we are here to help you&amp;quot;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9082417737575957020/comments/default/46059481874608675'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9082417737575957020/comments/default/46059481874608675'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/10/sheriff-david-clarke-warlord-of.html?showComment=1477053203021#c46059481874608675' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/10/sheriff-david-clarke-warlord-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9082417737575957020' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9082417737575957020' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1880356405"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 21, 2016 at 6:33 AM"/></entry></feed>